WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:01.730 line:95%,end
So, hi – my name is Janne.

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:10.270 line:95%,end
I'm the founder and CEO of Koivu Solutions, and our company has a product called Sotender,

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:14.310 line:95%,end
which helps to match nurses with open shifts.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:19.850 line:95%,end
The real value we create for customers, such as the wellbeing services

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.970 line:95%,end
counties in Finland:

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:28.530 line:95%,end
they can save a lot of money, while the nurses get work without the middleman.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:34.470 line:95%,end
For example, the Ostrobothnia region saves more than 7 million euros per year,

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:36.170 line:95%,end
thanks to Sotender.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.540 line:95%,end
So in Sweden, the main competition for us is the temp agencies.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.960 line:95%,end
As everybody knows, those are expensive –

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:47.680 line:95%,end
they can be two or three times more expensive when a nurse comes through a

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:52.200 line:95%,end
temp agency to the hospital or other organisations.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:57.240 line:95%,end
So for us, our solution helps to replace the temp agency and match the nurse

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.700 line:95%,end
with the open shift –

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.480 line:95%,end
a much more efficient, low-cost solution.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.840 line:95%,end
One important reason for us to join the PubliX Group:

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:12.510 line:95%,end
they help us expand in Sweden, Norway and other markets.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:16.880 line:95%,end
And given the discussions so far with the other CEOs,

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:23.740 line:95%,end
it is the opening of doors to the municipalities and regions in Sweden –

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:25.920 line:95%,end
and we really appreciate that help.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:29.010 line:95%,end
And that's where PubliX is a really good partner,

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:31.750 line:95%,end
to help us with the international expansion.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:35.790 line:95%,end
So we are looking forward to the next steps together with PubliX.
